{"ID":"20260207111601-2jwxjxd","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"icon":"1f3c0","id":"20260207111601-2jwxjxd","tags":"YoLo框架,目标检测","title":"YoLoV2","type":"doc","updated":"20260304191650"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260209131655-5lna48f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260209131655-5lna48f","updated":"20260209131655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260209131650-zxzp5y2.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260207111601-4sxe8rb","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260207111601-4sxe8rb","updated":"20260303125146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260209131559-so4zg2c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260209131559-so4zg2c","updated":"20260209131900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"YoLoV2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原名"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"YOLO9000:Beeter,Faster,Stronger"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更好、更快、更强的目标检测架构。是Joseph等人再2016年提出的新框架，主要就是再."},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260202093525-t8pxku0","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"YoLoV1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的基础之上进行的一些更改。"}]},{"ID":"20260209133508-9o31uuo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260209133508-9o31uuo","updated":"20260209133604"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"YOLOV2主要就是一些相对的改进，不过大多数都是细节层面的改进并非是框架或是结构上的大更新，后面的大更新是在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260207111650-ljbch8c","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"YoLoV3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中搞出来的。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260303125146-0eyq462","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260303125146-0eyq462","updated":"20260303125224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关于yolo环境的配置可以看："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260303104111-ljr4mxk","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"YoLo环境配置"}]},{"ID":"20260303125936-ht1276o","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260303125936-ht1276o","updated":"20260303130226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.创作背景"}]},{"ID":"20260303130003-5fcu5ic","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260303130003-5fcu5ic","updated":"20260303130112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在前一代，人们已经提出了"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260202093525-t8pxku0","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"YoLoV1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个算法实现了目标检测端到端的处理，并且检测的速度也相对较快，但是该方法存在两个较大的问题："}]},{"ID":"20260303130112-scvlxda","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260303130112-scvlxda","updated":"20260303130226"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260303130113-uhg6yf3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260303130113-uhg6yf3","updated":"20260303130113"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260303130113-ga2du5a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260303130113-ga2du5a","updated":"20260303130137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"研究实验发现，该算法架构针对小目标的检测定位误差很大"}]}]},{"ID":"20260303130137-poprh46","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260303130137-poprh46","updated":"20260303130226"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260303130137-ti6xlas","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260303130137-ti6xlas","updated":"20260303130226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模型的召回率低于以区域预测方法位置的模型架构例如"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260203094726-7rhefqi","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"Faster R-CNN"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之类的模型"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260209133841-gajdqy4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260209133841-gajdqy4","updated":"20260304100552"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2 YoLo-V2的模型整体架构设计"}]},{"ID":"20260303130305-0vt1bqm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260303130305-0vt1bqm","updated":"20260303130347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为了使得模型达到题目说的三个标准：更好、更快、更强，YoloV2在YoloV1的基础之上进行了比较大的更改。"}]},{"ID":"20260209133606-rx5afso","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260209133606-rx5afso","updated":"20260209133756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他的主要改进也已经在文章提出来了，如下图所示"}]},{"ID":"20260209133756-2u1dl98","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260209133756-2u1dl98","updated":"20260209133828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);","style":"height: 33vh;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260209133757-uobfbi1.png"},{"Type":"NodeLinkSpace"},{"Type":"NodeLinkTitle","Data":"YOLOV2相较于YOLOV1的改进"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"height: 33vh;\" parent-style=\"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260209133824-3oi79yj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260209133824-3oi79yj","updated":"20260304100552"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.1 Batch Normalization 批归一化"}]},{"ID":"20260209133906-6ex03z6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260209133906-6ex03z6","updated":"20260228102158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"也就是批归一化这边，V2版本整体舍弃了非常强大的DropOut并且在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"卷积之后全部加入了Batch Normalization。"}]},{"ID":"20260209134014-qfhqvm3","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260209134014-qfhqvm3","updated":"20260209134256"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260209134016-ccrj6bi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260209134016-ccrj6bi","updated":"20260209134108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"DropOut是全连接层这边使用的多，防止过拟合使用的。因为V2版本已经"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"没有了全连接层"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"啦！他的所有层均是卷积层"}]},{"ID":"20260209134115-6i2s3cr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260209134115-6i2s3cr","updated":"20260209134245"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"BN也就是归一化，保证卷积之后的均值为0并且其标准差为1，服从正态分布。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"N(0,1)"}]}]},{"ID":"20260209134256-v7c0kvt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260209134256-v7c0kvt","updated":"20260209134335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"网络的每一层的输入都做了归一化，它的网络收敛就相对容易一些。同时也是非常主流的一种方式了。"}]},{"ID":"20260209134350-w083086","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260209134350-w083086","updated":"20260209134527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260209134525-jejc7oa.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: parent-style=\"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260209134109-fqv5m51","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260209134109-fqv5m51","updated":"20260304100602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.2 hi-res classifier 更大的分辨率"}]},{"ID":"20260209134622-caimn5n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260209134622-caimn5n","updated":"20260209134805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之前的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260202093525-t8pxku0","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"YoLoV1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在训练时使用的图像均为固定的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"224\\times 224_esc_newline_"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而测试的时候均使用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"448\\times 448_esc_newline_"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个很抽象欸，这个训练的时候和测试的图像大小完全不同欸。很可能导致一些问题。"}]},{"ID":"20260228101922-fn3lbeg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260228101922-fn3lbeg","updated":"20260228102102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260202093525-t8pxku0","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"YoLoV1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中训练使用的是分类数据集，大小为224×224，然后进行迁移学习，微调的时候使用YOLO模型进行目标检测的过程中才将输入变成了448×448，这样改变尺寸的话，模型需要多学习一部分，带来大量的性能损失。"}]},{"ID":"20260228102113-2igeo85","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260228102113-2igeo85","updated":"20260228102145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"因此v2直接在预训练中输入的就是448×448的尺寸，微调的时候也是448 × 448"}]},{"ID":"20260209134906-6cdt9ew","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260209134906-6cdt9ew","updated":"20260209134928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260209134906-4zf9ptd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260209134906-4zf9ptd","updated":"20260209134928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个可能是当时的计算资源不够，算的太慢了，所以不得已而为之。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260209134805-hf6njbq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260209134805-hf6njbq","updated":"20260209134902"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此YoLoV2这里使用的方案便是增加了10次"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"448\\times 448_esc_newline_"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的微调。让网络模型架构适当的提升效果"}]},{"ID":"20260209134539-9o3f84j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260209134539-9o3f84j","updated":"20260209135040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260209135032-kn3eb0h.png"},{"Type":"NodeLinkSpace"},{"Type":"NodeLinkTitle","Data":"更大的分辨率"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260209135040-8nwlsbp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260209135040-8nwlsbp","updated":"20260209135214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"毕竟练习的时候用初中的知识，但是一但上到了考场之上，就变成了高中知识难免会出现水土不服的情况吧。"}]},{"ID":"20260228102208-a1fwmdr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260228102208-a1fwmdr","updated":"20260304100604"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.3带有Anchor Boxes的卷积"}]},{"ID":"20260228102209-asqyne2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260228102209-asqyne2","updated":"20260228102427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260203094726-7rhefqi","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"Faster R-CNN"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中引入了Anchor这个操作大大提升了速度，因此这里也用了这东西。首先需要说一下"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Anchor"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是个什么东西。"}]},{"ID":"20260228102312-sipbg44","Type":"NodeCallout","Properties":{"id":"20260228102312-sipbg44","updated":"20260228102348"},"CalloutType":"TIP","CalloutTitle":"Anchor","CalloutIcon":"💡","Children":[{"ID":"20260228102317-9iydwqj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260228102317-9iydwqj","updated":"20260228102343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Anchor就是一组预设的边框，在训练时，以真实的边框位置相对于预设边框的偏移来构建训练样本。 这就相当于，预设边框先大致在可能的位置"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"框"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出来目标，然后再在这些预设边框的基础上进行调整。"}]},{"ID":"20260228102348-hfuey1j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260228102348-hfuey1j","updated":"20260228102348"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"简言之就是在图像上预设好的不同大小，不同长宽比的参照框。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260228102306-o6cz85j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260228102306-o6cz85j","updated":"20260228102512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那么先验框有了，就需要说明一下什么是Anchor Boxes了。"}]},{"ID":"20260228102513-31tbtc5","Type":"NodeCallout","Properties":{"id":"20260228102513-31tbtc5","updated":"20260228102608"},"CalloutType":"TIP","CalloutTitle":"Anchor Boxes","CalloutIcon":"💡","Children":[{"ID":"20260228102522-mj79z1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260228102522-mj79z1h","updated":"20260228102608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一个Anchor Box可以由边框的纵横比和边框的面积来定义，相当于一系列预设边框的生成规则，根据Anchor Box，可以在图像的任意位置，生成一系列的边框。由于Anchor Box 通常是以CNN提取到的特征图片的点为中心位置，生成边框，所以一个Anchor Box不需要指定中心位置。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260228102611-y7mxnkd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260228102611-y7mxnkd","updated":"20260228102644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那么在YOLOv2中做了些什么事情呢。"}]},{"ID":"20260228102645-2f62pc2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260228102645-2f62pc2","updated":"20260228102840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"首先删除了"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260202093525-t8pxku0","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"YoLoV1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中的全连接层和最后一个池化层，这使得最后的卷积层具有更高的分辨率特征。\n其次缩小输入的图像，变成416×416。"}]},{"ID":"20260228102803-tyfmin5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260228102803-tyfmin5","updated":"20260228102839"}},{"ID":"20260209135222-zxb8h4d","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260209135222-zxb8h4d","updated":"20260304191650"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.4 修改网络架构"}]},{"ID":"20260209135817-rfecfnm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260209135817-rfecfnm","updated":"20260209135902"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在就仔细看看这两个框架有什么不同吧，这下面的两个表格分别表示了"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260202093525-t8pxku0","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"YoLoV1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（左边）以及YoloV2的网络架构图表。"}]},{"ID":"20260209135809-56tfkch","Type":"NodeSuperBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260209135809-56tfkch","updated":"20260209135640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockLayoutMarker","Data":"col"},{"ID":"20260209135640-m2ynzfq","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0,0,0,0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"|||","id":"20260209135640-m2ynzfq","updated":"20260209135640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Type"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Filters"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Size/Stride"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Output"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Convolutional"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"64"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7×7×3 +2"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"112 × 112"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Maxpool"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"-"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2×2 +2"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"56 × 56"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"