ata":"他的网络架构基本上都是采用了"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"3\\times3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的卷积，这个是借鉴了"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260206192147-45jp7aq","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"VGGNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260209140802-xwpmue9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260209140802-xwpmue9","updated":"20260209140852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"1\\times1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷积的使用主要就是为了节省参数，降低参数量的问题。"}]},{"ID":"20260304100627-0s3cbsr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304100627-0s3cbsr","updated":"20260304100656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"并且作者使用了卷积提取特征的网络架构也可以说是Darknet将原本的全连接神经网络架构进行替代"}]},{"ID":"20260304191650-ndmsfvb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304191650-ndmsfvb","updated":"20260304191650"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260304191650-59a6kr9.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260209140903-vnxqjqd","Type":"NodeCallout","Properties":{"id":"20260209140903-vnxqjqd","updated":"20260209141027"},"CalloutType":"CAUTION","CalloutTitle":"Caution","CalloutIcon":"🚨","Children":[{"ID":"20260209140911-mldvc7h","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260209140911-mldvc7h","updated":"20260209141027"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260209140914-27dfvwm","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260209140914-27dfvwm","updated":"20260209141026"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260209140914-eg0kw13","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260209140914-eg0kw13","updated":"20260209141026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"核心层全部为卷积或池化层不存在全连接层；"}]}]},{"ID":"20260209140927-m4dctl2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260209140927-m4dctl2","updated":"20260209141025"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260209140927-kr6g359","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260209140927-kr6g359","updated":"20260209141025"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷积核都使用较小的卷积核，比较好，感受野比较大一些；"}]}]},{"ID":"20260209140942-5nfzcwo","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20260209140942-5nfzcwo","updated":"20260209141027"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260209140942-th3qttn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260209140942-th3qttn","updated":"20260209141027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巧妙的使用1×1卷积，降低参数量。"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260209141531-12dz191","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260209141531-12dz191","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.总结一下"}]},{"ID":"20260304101012-dnfy1fd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-dnfy1fd","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"YOLOv2 放弃了 YOLOv1 那种直接“凭空”预测边界框宽高的做法，全面拥抱了基于 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Anchor Boxes（先验框/锚框）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的思路。"}]},{"ID":"20260304101012-ezyfzvp","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-ezyfzvp","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260304101012-odl4ehk","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-odl4ehk","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260304101012-f3hydva","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-f3hydva","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"维度聚类 (Dimension Clusters)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：\n在 Faster R-CNN 中，Anchor 的大小和比例是人工手动设定的（比如 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"3 \\times 3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 种）。但 YOLOv2 的作者认为，既然我们要让网络学会预测框，为什么不直接在训练集上提前找出最常见、最容易命中的框的形状呢？\n因此，YOLOv2 使用了 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"K-means 聚类算法"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 对训练集中的真实框（Ground Truth）进行聚类，最终通常选择 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"k=5"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 个最优的先验框大小。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260304101012-l4j5mf5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-l4j5mf5","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260304101012-93d2u34","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-93d2u34","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"绝对位置预测变更为偏移量预测 (Direct Location Prediction)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：\n引入 Anchor 后，网络不再直接预测框的中心绝对坐标，而是预测​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"相对于所在网格左上角的偏移量"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​。YOLOv2 使用了 Logistic 激活函数（即 Sigmoid）将预测值强行限制在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"0"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 到 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 之间，确保这个预测的框中心点始终落在当前的网格（Cell）内，网络更容易收敛。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260304101012-xe3qcja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-xe3qcja","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用数学公式来定义，YOLOv2 是这样计算最终预测框的："}]},{"ID":"20260304101012-l45mjqh","Type":"NodeMathBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-l45mjqh","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeMathBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockContent","Data":"\\begin{aligned}\nb_x \u0026= \\sigma(t_x) + c_x \\\\\nb_y \u0026= \\sigma(t_y) + c_y \\\\\nb_w \u0026= p_w e^{t_w} \\\\\nb_h \u0026= p_h e^{t_h}\n\\end{aligned}"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260304101012-tjelpwe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-tjelpwe","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"💡 Tip"}]},{"ID":"20260304101012-gy5mp5b","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-gy5mp5b","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260304101012-mnplt1s","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-mnplt1s","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260304101012-zw7vn1r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-zw7vn1r","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"t_x, t_y, t_w, t_h"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：是网络最后直接输出的预测值。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260304101012-33oi7nm","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-33oi7nm","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260304101012-159n768","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-159n768","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"c_x, c_y"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：是当前网格左上角相对于图像左上角的坐标。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260304101012-zouk01r","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-zouk01r","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260304101012-ym0b1bv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-ym0b1bv","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"p_w, p_h"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：是 K-means 聚类出来的先验框（Anchor）的宽和高。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260304101012-5c5872g","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-5c5872g","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260304101012-ms391nk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-ms391nk","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"\\sigma()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：Sigmoid 激活函数，确保偏置在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"0 \\sim 1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 之间。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260304101012-t0tcov2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-t0tcov2","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260304101012-byxrkns","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-byxrkns","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"b_x, b_y, b_w, b_h"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：最终计算出来的真实预测框的位置和尺寸。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260304101012-xnaazl7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-xnaazl7","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.2 具体网络结构：Darknet-19"}]},{"ID":"20260304101012-08f6xh0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-08f6xh0","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"YOLOv2 抛弃了 YOLOv1 后面的全连接层（Fully Connected Layers），变成了一个​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全卷积网络 (FCN)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​。它使用了一个全新的特征提取主干网络，称为 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Darknet-19"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​。"}]},{"ID":"20260304101012-6yxantr","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-6yxantr","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260304101012-blef763","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-blef763","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260304101012-isu3iu1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-isu3iu1","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"结构"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：包含 19 个卷积层和 5 个最大池化层（MaxPool）。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260304101012-ibpxdm1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-ibpxdm1","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260304101012-fp5m11j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-fp5m11j","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Batch Normalization"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：在每一个卷积层后面都加上了批归一化层（BN），这极大提升了模型的收敛速度，并且起到了正则化的作用，​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"直接允许作者移除了 Dropout 层"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260304101012-eb2qf8u","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-eb2qf8u","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260304101012-8hy9bn0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-8hy9bn0","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Passthrough 层（细粒度特征融合）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：为了解决 YOLOv1 对小物体检测差的问题，YOLOv2 引入了一个特殊的转移层。它将前面第 16 层的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"26 \\times 26 \\times 512"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的高分辨率特征图，通过重新排列（按空间拆分），变成 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"13 \\times 13 \\times 2048"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的特征图，然后和最后一层的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"13 \\times 13 \\times 1024"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 进行通道拼接（Concat）。这让网络同时具备了深层的语义信息和浅层的细粒度位置信息。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260304101012-z7jtkzo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-z7jtkzo","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"🚨 解决输入尺寸固定的缺陷：多尺度训练 (Multi-Scale Training)"}]},{"ID":"20260304101012-szj579o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-szj579o","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"YOLOv1 中因为有全连接层，输入图片必须是 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"448 \\times 448"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。YOLOv2 因为全是卷积层和池化层，理论上可以接受任何尺寸的输入。"}]},{"ID":"20260304101012-cnk3xmc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101012-cnk3xmc","updated":"20260304101012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为了让模型更鲁棒，作者在训练过程中，每隔 10 个 Batch 就会动态改变一次输入图像的尺寸（从 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"320 \\times 320"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 到 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"608 \\times 608"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，步长为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"32"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。这使得同一个网络能够适应不同分辨率的图像。"}]},{"ID":"20260304101405-68i53yp","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0,0,0,0,0,0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"|||||","id":"20260304101405-68i53yp","updated":"20260304101405"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"改进策略 (Trick)"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"具体做法与原理"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Properties":{"colspan":"4","rowspan":"1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: colspan=\"4\" rowspan=\"1\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"对模型的影响 (相对于 V1)"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Batch Normalization"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所有卷积层后加入 BN 层，移除 Dropout。"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"colspan":"4","rowspan":"1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: colspan=\"4\" rowspan=\"1\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"mAP 提升​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2%"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，加速收敛，防过拟合。"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"High-Resolution Classifier"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"训练分类网络时，最后阶段将 ImageNet 图片从 224 放大到 448 微调。"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"colspan":"4","rowspan":"1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: colspan=\"4\" rowspan=\"1\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"让网络有时间适应高分辨率输入，mAP 提升​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4%"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​。"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Convolutional with Anchor Boxes"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"移除全连接层，使用预设的 Anchor 框来预测相对偏移量。"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"colspan":"4","rowspan":"1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: colspan=\"4\" rowspan=\"1\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"mAP 略微下降，但​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"召回率 (Recall) 从 81% 暴涨到 88%"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"检测出的物体更多了。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Dimension Clusters"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用 K-means 在训练集上聚类出 5 个最合适的 Anchor 尺寸。"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"colspan":"4","rowspan":"1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: colspan=\"4\" rowspan=\"1\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比手动设定的 Anchor 更贴合真实数据，IOU 更高。"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Direct Location Prediction"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用 Sigmoid 限制中心点坐标偏移。"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"colspan":"4","rowspan":"1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: colspan=\"4\" rowspan=\"1\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"约束了预测范围，避免早期训练震荡，mAP 提升约​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5%"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​。"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Fine-Grained Features"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"引入 Passthrough 融合层，将前面浅层的高分辨率特征拼接到深层。"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"colspan":"4","rowspan":"1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: colspan=\"4\" rowspan=\"1\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显著提升了对"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"小物体"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的检测精度，mAP 提升​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1%"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​。"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Multi-Scale Training"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"训练时每 10 个 Batch 随机改变输入图片的尺寸（320"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"608）。"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"colspan":"4","rowspan":"1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: colspan=\"4\" rowspan=\"1\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"让模型适应各种分辨率，同一个权重在不同分辨率下都能用。"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Darknet-19 (Faster)"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采用 19 层卷积的全新 Backbone，替代 VGG 级别的笨重网络。"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"colspan":"4","rowspan":"1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: colspan=\"4\" rowspan=\"1\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"参数量大幅减少，计算量更少，速度更快，保持实时性。"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Properties":{"class":"fn__none"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: class=\"fn__none\"}"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260304101407-xnowoxo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101407-xnowoxo","updated":"20260304101524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此外yolov2的损失函数也是由四个部分组成的"}]},{"ID":"20260304101529-44zmoow","Type":"NodeMathBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260304101529-44zmoow","updated":"20260304101529"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeMathBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockContent","Data":"Loss = Loss_{coord} + Loss_{conf} + Loss_{class} + Loss_{prior}"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260304101529-nfie4pv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101529-nfie4pv","updated":"20260304101529"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"总损失"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"="},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"坐标偏移损失 + 置信度损失 + 分类损失 + 先验框稳定损失（仅训练前期）"}]},{"ID":"20260304101543-g38ba85","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-g38ba85","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 坐标偏移损失 (Coordinate Loss)"}]},{"ID":"20260304101543-p8xq2gg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-p8xq2gg","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"既然 YOLOv2 预测的是相对于 Anchor 的偏移量，那么它的坐标损失就是对比"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"预测偏移量"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"和"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"真实偏移量"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之间的差异。"}]},{"ID":"20260304101543-yv0f714","Type":"NodeMathBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-yv0f714","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeMathBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockContent","Data":"Loss_{coord} = \\lambda_{coord} \\sum_{i=0}^{W \\times H} \\sum_{j=0}^{A} \\mathbb{1}_{ij}^{obj} \\left[ (t_{x} - \\hat{t}_{x})^2 + (t_{y} - \\hat{t}_{y})^2 + (t_{w} - \\hat{t}_{w})^2 + (t_{h} - \\hat{t}_{h})^2 \\right]"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260304101543-qzh1p4c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-qzh1p4c","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"💡 Tip"}]},{"ID":"20260304101543-dc3vjis","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-dc3vjis","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260304101543-tj6z8lp","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-tj6z8lp","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260304101543-rjlpi5t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-rjlpi5t","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"W \\times H"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：特征图的网格大小（比如 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"13 \\times 13"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260304101543-htxmnvh","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-htxmnvh","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260304101543-4ohe46o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-4ohe46o","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"A"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：每个网格的 Anchor 数量（YOLOv2 中是 5）。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260304101543-nj3hju1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-nj3hju1","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260304101543-y54pz2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-y54pz2g","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"\\mathbb{1}_{ij}^{obj}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：指示函数，表示第 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"i"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 个网格的第 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"j"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 个 Anchor 是否是​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"正样本"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（IOU 最大）。只有正样本才计算坐标损失。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260304101543-qiycjfe","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-qiycjfe","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260304101543-og56tag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-og56tag","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"t_x, t_y, t_w, t_h"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：模型直接输出的预测数值。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260304101543-glrg55k","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-glrg55k","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260304101543-hxu7erv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-hxu7erv","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"\\hat{t}_{x}, \\hat{t}_{y}, \\hat{t}_{w}, \\hat{t}_{h}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：真实框（Ground Truth）反向推导出来的真实偏移量标签。V2 直接去拟合偏移量，而不是像 V1 那样去拟合宽高的根号，大大简化了计算。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260304101543-fhh68fb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-fhh68fb","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 置信度损失 (Confidence Loss)"}]},{"ID":"20260304101543-cqse1ty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-cqse1ty","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这部分和 V1 类似，但是因为有了“忽略样本”的机制，逻辑更加严密。"}]},{"ID":"20260304101543-jq1gyt3","Type":"NodeMathBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-jq1gyt3","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeMathBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockContent","Data":"\\begin{aligned}\nLoss_{conf} = \\quad \u0026 \\sum_{i=0}^{W \\times H} \\sum_{j=0}^{A} \\mathbb{1}_{ij}^{obj} (C_i - \\hat{C}_i)^2 \\\\\n\u0026 + \\lambda_{noobj} \\sum_{i=0}^{W \\times H} \\sum_{j=0}^{A} \\mathbb{1}_{ij}^{noobj} (C_i - \\hat{C}_i)^2\n\\end{aligned}"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260304101543-di8jhl5","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-di8jhl5","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260304101543-u2wjx4x","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-u2wjx4x","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260304101543-an9vpuz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-an9vpuz","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"如果包含物体（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"\\mathbb{1}_{ij}^{obj} = 1"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：我们要让预测的置信度 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"C_i"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 逼近真实的 IOU（即 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"\\hat{C}_i = IOU_{truth}^{pred}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260304101543-3xr3m1k","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-3xr3m1k","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260304101543-unazegv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-unazegv","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"如果没有物体（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"\\mathbb{1}_{ij}^{noobj} = 1"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：即负样本，我们要让预测的置信度 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"C_i"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 逼近 0（即 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"\\hat{C}_i = 0"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260304101543-gyzd8ed","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-gyzd8ed","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260304101543-diz3vgx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-diz3vgx","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同样，为了防止背景框太多淹没正样本，负样本的权重 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"\\lambda_{noobj}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 通常会设置得比较小（比如 0.5 或者 0.1）。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260304101543-oqxsdmi","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-oqxsdmi","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 分类损失 (Classification Loss)"}]},{"ID":"20260304101543-zj35uc7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-zj35uc7","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分类损失依然只计算那些真正框住物体的 Anchor。"}]},{"ID":"20260304101543-xtm2s5e","Type":"NodeMathBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-xtm2s5e","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeMathBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockContent","Data":"Loss_{class} = \\sum_{i=0}^{W \\times H} \\sum_{j=0}^{A} \\mathbb{1}_{ij}^{obj} \\sum_{c \\in classes} (p_i(c) - \\hat{p}_i(c))^2"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260304101543-hpfvb8f","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-hpfvb8f","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260304101543-4u5n16f","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-4u5n16f","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260304101543-7nuqkb6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-7nuqkb6","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"\\hat{p}_i(c)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 是真实的类别标签（One-hot 编码，对的类别是 1，错的是 0）。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260304101543-10sllme","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-10sllme","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260304101543-zjjgs0o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-zjjgs0o","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"p_i(c)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 是网络预测的该类别的条件概率。YOLOv2 在这里依然沿用了简单的均方误差（MSE）来处理分类。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260304101543-bcmc5co","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-bcmc5co","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 先验框稳定损失 (Prior Loss - 仅早期使用)"}]},{"ID":"20260304101543-r3hjs12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-r3hjs12","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这是一个在 YOLOv2 官方 Darknet C 语言源码中存在，但论文里一笔带过的细节。"}]},{"ID":"20260304101543-7t1g5mz","Type":"NodeMathBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-7t1g5mz","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeMathBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockContent","Data":"Loss_{prior} = \\text{在训练的前 12800 步中加入} \\sum_{i=0}^{W \\times H} \\sum_{j=0}^{A} \\left[ (t_{x} - 0)^2 + (t_{y} - 0)^2 + (t_{w} - 0)^2 + (t_{h} - 0)^2 \\right]"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260304101543-r38awrm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-r38awrm","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"💡 为什么要加这个？"}]},{"ID":"20260304101543-zxpdmwk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304101543-zxpdmwk","updated":"20260304101543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在训练刚开始的时候，网络是瞎猜的，预测出来的框可能会飞到图片外面去。为了让模型在早期保持稳定，作者加了一个极小的惩罚项：​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"即使这个 Anchor 没有匹配到任何物体，也强制要求它的预测偏移量趋近于 0"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（也就是让预测框尽量保持和 K-means 聚类出来的原始 Anchor 形状、位置一致）。等模型稍微学到一点特征后（12800步之后），这个损失项就被去掉了。"}]}]}